<title>RUSSIA: Reuters 14th ex-Moscow air cargo market report.</title>
<headline>Reuters 14th ex-Moscow air cargo market report.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Below are the current, average ex-Moscow-Sheremetyevo air cargo market rates in U.S. dollars per kg for a 100 kg shipment, with a volume-to-weight ratio of six to one.</p>
<p>These rates exclude any cargo fuel surcharges applied by foreign airlines.</p>
<p>		    June 24   May 23</p>
<p>			   EUROPE</p>
<p>    SVO-FRA	1.14	1.14</p>
<p>    SVO-LON	1.22	1.22</p>
<p>    SVO-LUX	1.35	1.35</p>
<p>			ASIA-PACIFIC</p>
<p>    SVO-BKK	3.31	3.32</p>
<p>    SVO-SEL	4.02	4.02</p>
<p>    SVO-NRT	4.29	4.30</p>
<p>			MIDDLE EAST</p>
<p>    SVO-DXB	2.03	2.03</p>
<p>    SVO-SHJ	2.40	2.40</p>
<p>			UNITED STATES</p>
<p>    SVO-MIA	3.37	3.37</p>
<p>    SVO-NYC	2.63	2.65</p>
<p>    SVO-SFO	3.26	3.26</p>
<p>The rates quoted in this report were obtained by Reuters on a confidential basis from a range of airlines, large forwarders and smaller air cargo agents based at Moscow's Sheremetyevo international airport. All prices are quoted in U.S. dollars.</p>
<p>The tariffs represent average rates calculated from a range of prices and are indicative of current market activity. - Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
